{"3968470": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Death Flags: The Beginning of the End – Chapter I", "steam_appid": 3968470, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968470/extras/05ab1ef31a8b751a6a09c8254abd5dc6.avif?t=1760659791\" width=402 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Step into the first chapter of an epic VR saga, where action</strong>, betrayal, and redemption collide in a world of revenge-driven pirates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968470/extras/3094cef5531f6953e531c044ad0fe515.poster.avif?t=1760659791\" width=650 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968470/extras/3094cef5531f6953e531c044ad0fe515.webm?t=1760659791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968470/extras/3094cef5531f6953e531c044ad0fe515.mp4?t=1760659791\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Death Flags is a VR rail shooter that blends intense, fast-paced action with cinematic storytelling. Blaze through chaotic environments as you fight off relentless waves of cursed pirates—each with their own skills and tactics—testing your aim and reflexes in increasingly challenging combat. With a scoring and combo system that rewards precision and speed, you’ll chain perfect shots, rack up massive multipliers, and unlock game-changing rewards and power-ups that make every run more thrilling and replayable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968470/extras/14353e9b4195ed5e6fa07a29e161f6bc.avif?t=1760659791\" width=566 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Escape through Fishbone Island—from burning villages and crumbling bazaars to King Viktor’s towering citadel. <strong>Each area offers alternate routes and branching paths, with dynamic difficulty options and extra challenges</strong> for those daring to push their limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968470/extras/39ebe02082f6edabdf77b0b377d34937.avif?t=1760659791\" width=683 height=297 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968470/extras/646a96ddc15928892078c59833727bb5.avif?t=1760659791\" width=566 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Face a cursed crew of twisted pirates:</strong> from gunmen and sword-wielders to kamikazes and minigun brutes. Every enemy features unique abilities, resistances, and attack patterns, ensuring no encounter feels the same. Boss fights will push your skills—and your nerves—to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968470/extras/f0f971f42bdce488209846ec1d3c6332.poster.avif?t=1760659791\" width=650 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968470/extras/f0f971f42bdce488209846ec1d3c6332.webm?t=1760659791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968470/extras/f0f971f42bdce488209846ec1d3c6332.mp4?t=1760659791\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968470/extras/b10f251ae06c2118425365e6a0927691.avif?t=1760659791\" width=566 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Combat evolves with special ammo types—explosive, poisonous, piercing, freezing and more—that radically change the behaviour of your pistols, letting you tailor your playstyle on the fly. Health boosts, extra time, and power pickups help you survive the toughest waves, while legendary power-ups like invincibility, double damage, and the brutal Pirate Fury mode tip the scales in your favour. VR customisation also lets you equip hand skins and cosmetic gear to make your pirate experience truly your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968470/extras/38734766ddf36d8a62372f74c03b4569.poster.avif?t=1760659791\" width=650 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968470/extras/38734766ddf36d8a62372f74c03b4569.webm?t=1760659791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968470/extras/38734766ddf36d8a62372f74c03b4569.mp4?t=1760659791\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Death Flags: The Beginning of the End is more than just a VR shooter—it’s your gateway to a cursed world of action, fantasy, and betrayal.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968470/extras/05ab1ef31a8b751a6a09c8254abd5dc6.avif?t=1760659791\" width=402 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Step into the first chapter of an epic VR saga, where action</strong>, betrayal, and redemption collide in a world of revenge-driven pirates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968470/extras/3094cef5531f6953e531c044ad0fe515.poster.avif?t=1760659791\" width=650 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968470/extras/3094cef5531f6953e531c044ad0fe515.webm?t=1760659791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968470/extras/3094cef5531f6953e531c044ad0fe515.mp4?t=1760659791\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Death Flags is a VR rail shooter that blends intense, fast-paced action with cinematic storytelling. Blaze through chaotic environments as you fight off relentless waves of cursed pirates—each with their own skills and tactics—testing your aim and reflexes in increasingly challenging combat. With a scoring and combo system that rewards precision and speed, you’ll chain perfect shots, rack up massive multipliers, and unlock game-changing rewards and power-ups that make every run more thrilling and replayable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968470/extras/14353e9b4195ed5e6fa07a29e161f6bc.avif?t=1760659791\" width=566 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Escape through Fishbone Island—from burning villages and crumbling bazaars to King Viktor’s towering citadel. <strong>Each area offers alternate routes and branching paths, with dynamic difficulty options and extra challenges</strong> for those daring to push their limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968470/extras/39ebe02082f6edabdf77b0b377d34937.avif?t=1760659791\" width=683 height=297 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968470/extras/646a96ddc15928892078c59833727bb5.avif?t=1760659791\" width=566 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Face a cursed crew of twisted pirates:</strong> from gunmen and sword-wielders to kamikazes and minigun brutes. Every enemy features unique abilities, resistances, and attack patterns, ensuring no encounter feels the same. Boss fights will push your skills—and your nerves—to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"ht